<!--
  openEMS's azimuthal multigrid (MultiGrid="2": one zone boundary at
  rho = 2 mm) on a closed cylindrical cavity with the axis (rho 0..5 mm,
  24 alpha cells, z 0..6 mm); E and H dumps over the zone whose last
  sample is the step the run ends on (openEMS's H of the following
  update, ems's look-ahead through the multigrid operator).
  Hand-written for the ems dump fixtures (scripts/openems-oracle/gen-dumps.sh).
-->
